escription":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":15,"description":"Stats"},{"id":25,"description":"Steam Leaderboards"},{"id":44,"description":"Remote Play Together"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"1968730","steamName":"Bounty of One","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1968730/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:21:21.331481+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Fallen hero of the Wild West, you’re wanted and in disgrace! Grab your guns, survive endless hordes of bounty hunters and fight to clear your name! Bounty of One is a fast-paced casual roguelite bullet hell for 1 to 4 players. Dash, Dodge, Shoot, Repeat!","detailedDescription":"The Undertaker has taken over the valley of Greenhill and all who oppose him are now on the run. A bounty has been put on your head and all the minions of the necromancer are coming for you aiming to claim it. You survive the onslaught and clear your name? \n\nBounty Of One is a fast-paced casual roguelite survivor-like where mobility is key. Play solo or with your friends up to four players on the same screen or remotely with ‘Steam Play Together.’\n\nAlone or with your crew, defeat endless waves of bounty hunters. Upgrade your skills as fast as possible to survive ever-stronger waves of enemies. Collaborate with your friends and split the loot smartly (or don’t, it’s up to you)!\n\nUnleash hell on your foes and don’t get caught\n\nResist and more will come for you! But you are well prepared and you will show no mercy!\n\nChoose wisely how to upgrade your skills.Each run is different,ill you focus on attack speed? Damage? Or something more exotic?\n\nDiscover powerful equipment to help you in your quest.\n\nBeat the elites and bosses and get their precious loot, which can really change your game style. Some will improve your offensive skills, others the defensive one and some will do a lot of boom boom!\n\n80+ different items!\n\nTry each character: they have their own playstyle with different advantages and flaws. \n\nDefeat mighty bosses. Fight your way through the sheriffs and deputies serving the evil Undertaker. Find your nemesis, beat him and make him pay!","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968730/ef8941f7eece2a4827c5ae1363b12af36152effa/header.jpg?t=1771497196"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968730/b7b6855c7123d4c79b87b26ae7e505c92df4f65e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771497196"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968730/extras/bd6bc627f86af5a973faa09513fc041b.avif?t=1771497196","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968730/extras/e6c98493262ae69a1e086a3539a9ecc6.avif?t=1771497196","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968730/extras/8a96032c8cae53e4ac5643a8f7afb82f.avif?t=1771497196","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968730/extras/c70dbbcda21f0541cee5df9106ab34c0.avif?t=1771497196","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968730/extras/4256b919c7483714eee976232c2f571d.avif?t=1771497196","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968730/extras/d8d71345fd4c40fd8f3ebb012688be14.avif?t=1771497196","alt":""}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968730/ss_1647fbda9a2b10c2490d7eb9a6c0c3d8449b2873.600x338.jpg?t=1771497196","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it